      <h1 id="stage-04-a-task-and-a-reference" class="group scroll-mt-20">Stage 04: A task and a reference<a href="#stage-04-a-task-and-a-reference" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h1>
      <p>Add two information types to the guide. <em>Recording your first track</em> is a <code>&lt;task&gt;</code> with steps that lead to a result. <em>Supported audio formats</em> is a <code>&lt;reference&gt;</code> with a table of facts.</p>
      <p>Concepts explain a subject, tasks describe actions, and references provide information to look up. Each type has a content model that controls its structure. Validation checks that structure; you must also review whether the content serves the topic's purpose.</p>
